   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Do you like the breasts of women from another world?\"\nAdventurers, elves, beastkin… You'll be overwhelmed by sexy, soft breasts of beautiful fantasy women from another world!\nIntroducing an anthology comic where you're sure to find breasts to your liking!\n\n**Contents:**\n1. By Kameyoshi Ichiko.\n2. By Nakamura Inui.\n3. By Suzune Rena.\n4. By Narumi Amiya.\n5. \"Densetsu no Majo, Sono Na wa Reva\" (伝説の魔女、その名はレヴァ, \"The Legendary Witch, Known as Reva\"). By Nanatsu Fuji.\n6. By Yousei Tanumochi.\n7. By Mokoyama Jin.\n8. By Kokanno Tent.",
   "ja": "「異世界お姉さんのおっぱいはお好きですか…？」冒険者、エルフ、獣人…異世界におわすファンタジー美女のエッチでふわふわなおっぱいにたじたじ！ \nあなた好みのおっぱいがきっと見つかるアンソロジーコミック、登場！"
